A more effective strategy would be to introduce some randomness and ensure that the selection process favors both exploitation of known good solutions and exploration of unknown regions of the search space. This can be achieved by combining elements of tournament selection with a focus on maintaining diversity in the archive.

We will modify the `select_competitor` method to:
