2. Prioritize selecting individuals with higher fitness scores.
3. Occasionally select less fit individuals to maintain diversity.

By doing so, we aim to balance between leveraging existing knowledge and exploring uncharted territories, thereby potentially breaking the global SOTA peak accuracy and discovering novel, high-performing architectures.
